<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #FFF9F2;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #5D4037;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            border: 1px solid #FFEBD6;
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E67E22, #C45C1A);
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 26px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .header p {
            color: #FFEBD6;
            margin: 5px 0 0 0;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }
        .content h2 {
            color: #C45C1A;
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        .order-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }
        .order-table th {
            text-align: left;
            padding: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #FFEBD6;
            color: #8D6E63;
            font-weight: 600;
            width: 40%;
        }
        .order-table td {
            padding: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #FFEBD6;
        }
        .total-row {
            background-color: #FFF9F2;
        }
        .total-row th, .total-row td {
            color: #C45C1A !important;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .status-box {
            background-color: #FFF3E0;
            border-left: 4px solid #E67E22;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #F8F9FA;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #888;
            border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        }
        .highlight {
            color: #E67E22;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Halwa Kadai</h1>
            <p>Order Confirmed! 🍯</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <h2>Thank you for your order!</h2>
            <p>Hi <strong>[[Customer_Name]]</strong>,</p>
            <p>Your sweets are being prepared with traditional care. Here are your order details:</p>

            <table class="order-table">
                <tr>
                    <th>Order Number</th>
                    <td>#[[Order_Number]]</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Order Date</th>
                    <td>[[Order_Date]]</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th>Items</th>
                    <td>[[Item_List]]</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="total-row">
                    <th>Total Amount</th>
                    <td>₹[[Total_Amount]]</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <div class="status-box">
                <strong>What's next?</strong><br />
                We'll notify you as soon as your order is ready for delivery or pickup. You can track your order status in your profile.
            </div>

            <p>Sweet regards,<br />
            <span class="highlight">The Halwa Kadai Team</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            © 2026 Halwa Kadai. Deliciously Traditional.<br />
            This is an automated receipt for your purchase. Please do not reply.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>